OL,3,GNEWSAThree 'outdated' care facilities
OL,4,Acould close
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree council-run care facilities in
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire could close because
OL,8,Fthey "do not meet or reflect modern
OL,9,Fstandards".
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council is
OL,12,Freviewing its in-house services for
OL,13,Fadults, including day services and
OL,14,Fspecialist support for younger adults
OL,15,Fwith disabilities.
OL,17,FAs part of the review the council is
OL,18,Fconsidering proposals to shut Obelisk
OL,19,FHouse and Southfields House care homes,
OL,20,Fand Eleanor Lodge that helps people
OL,21,Faged from 18 to 65.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
