OL,3,GNEWSAThree 'outdated' care facilities
OL,4,Acould close
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Laura Couse, from the Reform
OL,7,FUK-led council, said its
OL,8,Frecommendations "will be difficult for
OL,9,Fsome people" but will be discussed
OL,10,Fcarefully and sensitively at a cabinet
OL,11,Fmeeting on Tuesday.
